<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/202006092%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Tor Tignosa";
    rdfs:comment "Tor Tignosa, mapped and listed in the 17th century Catasto Alessandrino as a landed estate, is a ruined stone structure located some 8 km northeast of Lavinium. Multiple votive inscriptions were found in the vicinity, providing evidence for an ancient sanctuary dating to between the fifth and second centuries BCE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/202006092> .

