<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/208943653%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Unnamed settlement near Bir el Kerma, Algeria";
    rdfs:comment "Remains of an ancient settlement of Roman date, recorded by Gsell (AAA, whence BAtlas). The location should lie within a kilometer of the BAtlas coordinates: a point near modern Bir el Kerma, which is located in the modern municipal territory of Tixter (Bordj Bou Arreridj willaya).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/208943653> .

