        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/560353%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/734000266%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An island of the Cyclades that is now uninhabited. The Cambridge Keros Project identified a large Bronze Age settlement on the island.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/212270979> .

