<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/220956447%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Clausura Bir Oum Ali";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/324678%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The so-called Clausura Bir Oum Ali is part of a defensive barrier that formed part of the Limes Numidiae of the ancient Roman empire. This system of military outposts and fortifications closed off the Roman province of Africa Proconsularis to the south.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/220956447> .

