    rdfs:label "S. Cruz";
    rdfs:comment "The Roman Villa of Baños de Valdearados, also known as the Villa de Santa Cruz, is located in Baños de Valdearados, Burgos region of Ribera del Duero, in Castilla y León (Spain). A Late Imperial Roman villa (fourth and fifth centuries CE) with polychrome mosaics is located at the site.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/236645> .

