<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/24323808%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Thrace/Skudra (satrapy)";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/501520%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/501634%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/520985%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/961678240%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A satrapy of the Achaemenid Persian empire established in Thrace in 513 BC by Darius I and Megabazus and abandoned in 479 BC following the failure of Xerxes' invasion of Greece. It was a minor satrapy, subordinate to the central main satrapy of Lydia.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/24323808> .

