    rdfs:label "Gent";
    rdfs:comment "Archaeological remains of a large Roman town that Gsell (AAA) places 10 kilometers east of the Gent farm (\"ferme Gent\"); so, to judge from his map, on high ground north of the modern Oued Mekkera near the boundary between the communes of Boudjebaa El Bordj and El Gaada in Algeria's Mascara province.";
