    rdfs:label "Ain Bessem";
    rdfs:comment "Gsell (AAA, whence BAtlas) noted the remains of a hexagonal fort located about 2.5 kilometers northwest of Aïn Bessem. His description relies primarily on earlier reports, since the ruins had been almost entirely quarried out by the early 20th century.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/295210> .

