    dcterms:contributor <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/gmckee>;
    dcterms:description "Mound site in Amasya province, Turkey. First inhabited in the Early Bronze Age (ca. 4500 BCE), the site was abandoned sometime during the Hittite Period (15th-13th centuries BCE). It was briefly resettled during the Iron Age-Hellenistic period (8th-1st centuries BCE).";
