    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Info.roma.it 11164: Osteria Cessati Spiriti",
        "Wikipedia (Italian) Via dei Cessati Spiriti";
    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:description "In the Notizie degli Scavi di Antichità for 1884, R. Lanciani reports the find of a monolithic, anepigraphic Roman sarcophagus at the Osteria Cessati Spiriti. The sarcophagus had been discovered in a pozzolana quarry and relocated to the grounds of the osteria. Brickstamps dating to 123 CE were reportedly observed at its reputed findspot.";
