<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/226697%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Nikonion";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/226799%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Nikonion received a sixth-century B.C. colony from either Miletos or Istros. It was assessed tribute by the Delian League in 425/4 B.C. Authors such as Pseudo-Skylax refer to the site as a polis in the urban sense. The colony was under the protection of the Skythian king Skyles. The ancient city was located on the on east bank of the Dniester river where Roksolany, Ukraine, is now located.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/226697> .

