        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/771100775%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Cn. Pompeius Magnus is considered to have been the founder of Pompelo (modern Pamplona) while on campaign against Sertorius in 75 BC.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/246567> .

