    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/291526921%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A rock-cut Etrusco-Roman sanctuary sacred to Demeter that was discovered during rescue excavations in 2006 following looting activity. The sanctuary, set in a grove, remained in use until the second century A.D.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/251060662> .

