<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/265764718%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Kiln Quarter at Histria";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/216839%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The kiln quarter of Histria featured multiple ceramic kilns, workspaces, and waste deposits organized in a distinct, non-residential zone. Stratified layers reveal repeated building and reuse, with broken kilns repurposed as floors or refuse pits. It is located on the western plateau of the settlement.";
