    dcterms:description "Strabo describes this sanctuary in his narrative of sailing up the Guadalquivir River. His text mentions a sanctuary of Phosphorus - this is likely Diana - that is known as \"Lux Dubia\" (Strabo transliterates \"Lucem dubiam\" to Greek characters, thus λοῦκεμ δουβίαν).";
