    dcterms:description "The kiln quarter of Histria featured multiple ceramic kilns, workspaces, and waste deposits organized in a distinct, non-residential zone. Stratified layers reveal repeated building and reuse, with broken kilns repurposed as floors or refuse pits. It is located on the western plateau of the settlement.";
